<title>UK: FHC sets 2.0 bln ffr 12-year pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>FHC sets 2.0 bln ffr 12-year pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frankfurter Hypotheken Central AG on Thursday launched the first Pfandbrief denominated in French francs, joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Morgan Stanley said.</p>
<p>The bond will be priced to yield 16 b.p. over the interpolated 8.50 pct October 2008 and 6.50 pct April 2011 OATs. Full details follow.</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    21.APR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    21.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100-1M    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	WILL BE REDENOMINATED INTO EUROS AFTER THIRD STAGE</p>
<p>		OF EMU</p>
<p>		**TO BE PRICED</p>
</text>
